{"id":"trottoir","lemma":"trottoir","pos":"noun","rank":3486,"glosses":["sidewalk, pavement, footpath (paved path located at the side of a road for the use of pedestrians)"],"ipa":"/tʁɔ.twaʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a4/Fr-trottoir.ogg/Fr-trottoir.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"trottoirs"},"formAudio":{"trottoirs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-trottoirs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Arrêtez-vous le long du trottoir.","en":"Pull up to the curb.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102828","words":[{"g":"to stop","l":"arrêter"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"long"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Le trottoir est glissant.","en":"The pavement is slippery.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to slip","l":"glisser"}]},{"text":"Les trottoirs étaient mouillés après la pluie.","en":"The sidewalks were wet after the rain.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"wet, moist","l":"mouillé"},{"g":"after"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"rain"}]},{"text":"Il y avait du sang sur le trottoir.","en":"There was blood on the pavement.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"blood"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Le trottoir est encore un peu glissant.","en":"The sidewalk is still a bit slippery.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"still"},null,null,{"g":"to slip","l":"glisser"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"a little, a bit"]]}]}